{"data": {"event": {"id": "546401b9-f0b5-459e-80ed-d9398aa50281", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Masses annexielles de A \u00e0 Z", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T16:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les principaux crit\u00e8res \u00e9chographiques des masses annexielles</strong> et utiliser l\u2019\u00e9chographie comme outil de triage pour identifier les l\u00e9sions n\u00e9cessitant une caract\u00e9risation compl\u00e9mentaire.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Caract\u00e9riser les masses annexielles en IRM</strong>, en s\u2019appuyant sur les s\u00e9quences morphologiques et fonctionnelles afin de r\u00e9duire l\u2019incertitude diagnostique et d\u2019orienter le diagnostic \u00e9tiologique.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Int\u00e9grer les donn\u00e9es d\u2019imagerie dans la d\u00e9cision th\u00e9rapeutique</strong>, en adaptant le compte rendu aux besoins du gyn\u00e9cologue-oncologue et en contribuant \u00e0 la strat\u00e9gie de prise en charge.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "9fcb28b3-5fb3-4d5d-ac63-87d53367941e", "name": "251", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "b9450730-2792-44e7-bf73-8f7b79ef3191", "title": "\u00c9chographie des masses annexielles : un outil de triage, pas de caract\u00e9risation", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T15:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "B9450730-2792-44E7-BF73-8F7B79EF3191"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "a3832967-fa31-4e47-bb90-c5e992b71423", "lastName": "Assouline", "firstName": "Victoria", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=2